      "comment": "Demyan: Fatui and the Experimental Design Bureau",
      "content": "Demyan notes that since the Fatui established an experimental design bureau on Paha Isle, the mood around town has shifted; some say it is because of their fight with the Wild Hunt. Some locals resent their swagger, others want their technology. After the bureau suffered a heavy blow, he adds that many people, not only the Scions, were pleased, but advises keeping that private.",
